#MOBPROGS
#30030
* speech "echoes": every echo, and a bad mob command
mob echo The stage manager rings a bell.
mob echoat $n Psst, $n, you're on next.
mob echoaround $n The stage manager whispers to $n.
mob echoat $n
mob asound You hear a bell from the temple.
mob zecho Places, everyone in Midgaard!
mob gecho Curtain up across the world!
mob gecho
mob zecho
mob nosuchcommand
mob
say echoes done
~
#30031
* speech "loads": mobs and objects
mob mload 3062
mob mload 30099
mob mload nonsense
mob oload 3001
mob oload 3001 0 R
mob oload 3716 1 W
mob oload 3001 99
mob oload 3001 level
mob oload nonsense
mob oload 30099
mob oload 3010 0
say loads done
~
#30032
* speech "junk": by name, worn, all of a kind, and all
mob oload 3001
mob oload 3001
mob oload 3002
mob junk bottle
mob junk banner
mob junk all.bottle
mob junk nosuchthing
mob junk all
mob junk
say junk done
~
#30033
* speech "purge": a mob by name, an object by name, a player (refused), and everything
mob purge fido
mob purge bottle
mob purge $n
mob purge nosuchthing
mob purge
say purge done
~
#30034
* speech "travel": goto, at, transfer, gtransfer and otransfer
mob goto 3005
say I'm in the square.
mob goto 3001
mob at 3005 say Said from the square.
mob at 3005
mob transfer $n 3005
mob transfer $n
mob transfer all 3014
mob transfer $n
mob gtransfer $n 3005
mob gtransfer $n
mob oload 3001 0 R
mob otransfer bottle 3005
mob oload 3716 1 W
mob otransfer banner 3005
mob otransfer bottle 99999
mob otransfer
mob goto 99999
mob goto
mob transfer
mob transfer nobody 3005
mob transfer $n
mob transfer pupil
say travel done
~
#30035
* speech "forces": force, force all, gforce and vforce
mob force $n say I am forced.
mob force all smile
mob gforce $n nod
mob vforce 30006 say The understudy is forced.
mob vforce nonsense say no
mob force $n
mob force self say no
say forces done
~
#30036
* speech "spells": each kind of target
mob cast armor $n
mob cast 'cure light' $n
mob cast blindness understudy
mob cast blindness self
mob cast 'detect invis'
mob cast 'create food'
mob cast bless $n
mob oload 3021
mob cast 'enchant weapon' sword
mob cast nosuchspell
mob cast
say spells done
~
#30037
* speech "hurt": damage within the hit points, all, and with kill
mob damage $n 1 3
mob damage $n 100 200
mob damage all 1 2
mob damage $n 1 2 kill
mob damage $n nonsense 2
mob damage $n 1 nonsense
mob damage nobody 1 2
mob damage
say hurt done
~
#30038
* speech "remember": remember, forget, delay and cancel
mob remember $n
say I remember $q.
mob forget
say I remember $q.
mob remember
mob delay 2
if isdelay $i
  say A delay is set.
endif
mob cancel
if isdelay $i
  say not reached
else
  say No delay now.
endif
mob delay nonsense
mob delay 2
say remember done
~
#30039
* speech "subroutine": mob call, with a character and objects
mob oload 3001 0 R
mob call 30045 $n bottle null
mob call 30045
mob call 30099
mob call
say subroutine done
~
#30040
* speech "flee": not fighting, it goes
mob flee
~
#30041
* speech "fight": kill a player, assist one fighting
mob kill $n
mob kill understudy
mob assist $n
mob kill
say fight done
~
#30042
* speech "strip": take objects back by vnum and all
mob remove $n 3716
mob remove $n nonsense
mob remove $n all
say strip done
~
#30043
* speech "deep": a program that calls itself, past MAX_CALL_LEVEL
say Deeper.
mob call 30043 $n
~
#30044
* delay: when the delay runs out
say The delay ran out.
~
#30045
* called by mob call
say Called for $n with $o, and $p.
~
